 "descripcion": "Nora takes the last bus home every night. Twenty minutes, same route. Tonight it drove for forty minutes without stopping, and let her off at Hollow Pines.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you get off?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
